# ExtJS 2.x (security MM2)

Retained on purpose for the Kloxo-MR panel UI (left tree, dialogs, ajax
forms). Do not delete without a UI rewrite.

- Loaded only from `/theme/extjs/` on this host (no CDN).
- Do not add new ExtJS eval of untrusted strings; prefer JSON.parse paths
  already used for ajax (see N19 / htmllib).
- EOL library: treat as UI dependency debt, not a mail/auth surface.
